{"id":"1b42c29cdcade905","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-tree-ordinal-predecessor.md","title":"树序数的有限前驱集","display":"df-tree-ordinal-predecessor — 树序数的有限前驱集","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-tree-ordinal-predecessor","aliases":["72-df-tree-ordinal-predecessor"],"display":"df-tree-ordinal-predecessor — 树序数的有限前驱集","chapter":"III","depends_on":["[[72-df-tree-ordinal]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.III Def.2.6; print154; PDF166","verification_status":"source-definition-checked","source_statement_status":"checked-against-book","proof_status":"definition-well-defined","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-tree-ordinal-predecessor"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-tree-ordinal-predecessor</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-tree-ordinal-predecessor — 树序数的有限前驱集"},{"key":"chapter","html":"III"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2e4aa3df9477aa6f\" href=\"?note=2e4aa3df9477aa6f\" title=\"72-df-tree-ordinal\">72-df-tree-ordinal</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.III Def.2.6; print154; PDF166"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-against-book"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"definition-well-defined"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega,\\mathbf0,\\mathsf S,\\mathsf L,\\prec\">\\(\\Omega,\\mathbf0,\\mathsf S,\\mathsf L,\\prec\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2e4aa3df9477aa6f\" href=\"?note=2e4aa3df9477aa6f\" title=\"72-df-tree-ordinal\">72-df-tree-ordinal</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\Omega\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\Omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha[n]\">\\(\\alpha[n]\\)</span> 是下式定义的有限子树集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_n(\\alpha)\">\\(P_n(\\alpha)\\)</span> 是相对于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prec\">\\(\\prec\\)</span> 的最大前驱，空集时取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf0\">\\(\\mathbf0\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\">\\(\\iota\\)</span> 只在存在唯一见证时使用。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf0[n]\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\qquad(\\mathsf S\\alpha)[n]\\coloneqq\\alpha[n]\\cup\\{\\alpha\\},\\qquad(\\mathsf L((\\alpha_i)_{i\\in\\omega}))[n]\\coloneqq\\alpha_n[n].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf0[n]\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\qquad(\\mathsf S\\alpha)[n]\\coloneqq\\alpha[n]\\cup\\{\\alpha\\},\\qquad(\\mathsf L((\\alpha_i)_{i\\in\\omega}))[n]\\coloneqq\\alpha_n[n].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"P_n(\\alpha)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\mathbf0,&amp;\\alpha[n]=\\varnothing,\\\\\\iota\\beta\\in\\alpha[n]\\ \\forall\\gamma\\in\\alpha[n]\\ (\\gamma=\\beta\\lor\\gamma\\prec\\beta),&amp;\\alpha[n]\\ne\\varnothing.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[P_n(\\alpha)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\mathbf0,&amp;\\alpha[n]=\\varnothing,\\\\\\iota\\beta\\in\\alpha[n]\\ \\forall\\gamma\\in\\alpha[n]\\ (\\gamma=\\beta\\lor\\gamma\\prec\\beta),&amp;\\alpha[n]\\ne\\varnothing.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：第 III 章 Definition 2.6，印刷 p.154 / PDF p.166。按树秩归纳，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha[n]\">\\(\\alpha[n]\\)</span> 有限且为严格子树的线性链：零情形为空；后继在既有链顶端加入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>；极限继承一个直接子树的链。因此非空分支存在唯一最大元，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_n\">\\(P_n\\)</span> 是全函数。没有把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha[n]\">\\(\\alpha[n]\\)</span> 误写成单个基本序列元素。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-tree-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"2e4aa3df9477aa6f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-tree-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-tree-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"2e4aa3df9477aa6f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Omega,\\mathbf0,\\mathsf S,\\mathsf L,\\prec$ 见 [[72-df-tree-ordinal]]，$\\alpha\\in\\Omega$，$n\\in\\omega$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Omega,\\mathbf0,\\mathsf S,\\mathsf L,\\prec","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\in\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha[n]","display":false},{"tex":"P_n(\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"\\prec","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf0","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf0[n]\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\qquad(\\mathsf S\\alpha)[n]\\coloneqq\\alpha[n]\\cup\\{\\alpha\\},\\qquad(\\mathsf L((\\alpha_i)_{i\\in\\omega}))[n]\\coloneqq\\alpha_n[n].","display":true},{"tex":"P_n(\\alpha)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\mathbf0,&\\alpha[n]=\\varnothing,\\\\\\iota\\beta\\in\\alpha[n]\\ \\forall\\gamma\\in\\alpha[n]\\ (\\gamma=\\beta\\lor\\gamma\\prec\\beta),&\\alpha[n]\\ne\\varnothing.\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\alpha[n]","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"P_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha[n]","display":false}],"bytes":1707,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-223","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-tree-ordinal-predecessor|df-tree-ordinal-predecessor — 树序数的有限前驱集]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-221","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[df-tree-ordinal-predecessor — 树序数的有限前驱集](72-df-tree-ordinal-predecessor.md)"},{"id":"1c0b1d31927046ab","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"树序数编码及严格子树关系见 [[72-df-tree-ordinal]]，有限前驱集见 [[72-df-tree-ordinal-predecessor]]。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-238","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-tree-ordinal-predecessor|df-tree-ordinal-predecessor — 树序数的有限前驱集]]"},{"id":"3f09cae20e23b713","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Omega,\\mathbf0,\\mathsf S,\\mathsf L,\\prec,\\alpha[n],P_n(\\alpha)$ 见 [[72-df-tree-ordinal-predecessor]]；$\\alpha\\in\\Omega$，$n\\in\\omega$。"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-327","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-tree-ordinal-predecessor]]"}],"outgoing":["2e4aa3df9477aa6f"]}